/F1 10 Tf 14 TL (3. Health screening. Before move-in, and at least annually after move-in, the community) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf 14 TL (performs a health screening. The purpose of the screening is to assess the resident's) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf 14 TL (health status and to arrange or procure appropriate services. The screening is not used) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf 14 TL (to keep out residents who may later need care. If the resident needs assistance with) Tj T*
